WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.550
AI models generate proposals as bounded,
structured actions that describe intended
changes or tasks within a system, ensuring
clarity and scope before any execution.

2
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:21.250
Deterministic .NET code validates these
proposals by checking schemas, identities,
permissions, budgets, and side effects to
ensure they meet all system rules and
constraints.

3
00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:34.500
Humans approve consequential work after
validation. Applying a proposal differs
from production approval, and a successful
build or render does not equal release
approval, maintaining clear authority
boundaries.
